<H3 align="center" paddingBottom="24">STAGECALL</H3>
<Section blockColor="#13131E" blockBorderRadius="22" paddingTop="32" paddingRight="24" paddingBottom="28" paddingLeft="24">
  <H2 paddingBottom="10">YOU'RE ON THE LIST</H2>
  <H1 paddingBottom="12">Welcome to StageCall</H1>
  <Paragraph><Text textColor="#8888AA">Thanks for signing up. You'll be among the first to hear when StageCall opens for early access.</Text></Paragraph>
</Section>
<H2 paddingTop="32" paddingBottom="12">WHAT STAGECALL DOES</H2>
<Paragraph paddingBottom="12"><Text textColor="#F5B942">Calls that fire on time.</Text> <Text textColor="#8888AA">Set "Half hour", "Overture call" and "Places" once. StageCall alerts the crew at the right moment.</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph paddingBottom="12"><Text textColor="#F5B942">Only your team's alerts.</Text> <Text textColor="#8888AA">Sound, Lighting, Wardrobe and Stage Management each get their own calls, nothing more.</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph paddingBottom="12"><Text textColor="#F5B942">One tap clears the call.</Text> <Text textColor="#8888AA">Any team member acknowledges for the whole team, and managers can edit calls live.</Text></Paragraph>
<H2 paddingTop="20" paddingBottom="12">WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</H2>
<Paragraph><Text textColor="#8888AA">StageCall is in active development. We'll email you when early access opens and when there is news worth sharing. No spam.</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph paddingTop="20">The StageCall team</Paragraph>
<Divider paddingTop="28" paddingBottom="8" color="#1C1C2E" />
<Paragraph fontSize="12" align="center"><Text textColor="#4A4A6A">You received this because you signed up at stagecall-app.nl. Not you? You can safely ignore this email.</Text></Paragraph>
